WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.660 --> 00:00:16.021
Wish I could erase the words “love” from my heart

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:21.294
Don’t wanna fall apart if someday

00:00:21.294 --> 00:00:24.290
You just go away

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:29.410
And leave me here alone

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:37.018
But today I let my heart get lost in you

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:42.014
The feeling deep inside is ringing true

00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:44.705
’Cause every time I see you

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:50.363
It feels like I’ve found true love

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:56.632
Though I tried so hard not to love, not to feel

00:00:56.630 --> 00:01:03.003
In the end, my heart took over,
telling me this love is real

00:01:03.600 --> 00:01:07.687
My whole heart still keeps on missing you like this

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:13.010
You’re like a love song that I can’t forget

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:17.665
I still hear your voice every minute

00:01:17.665 --> 00:01:20.670
Your image never fades

00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:25.003
No matter how I try to erase it

